# Claude Code Marketplaces
# Format: github_org/repo, or a full git URL for non-standard repos.
# Used by: scripts/install_claude.sh  (dotfiles install --claude)
#
# Deliberately small. This list previously carried 20 marketplaces and 36
# plugins; most were installed once, never used, and every one of them costs
# context on every session plus a network round-trip on every bootstrap.
# What remains is the process backbone plus whatever the bootstrap itself
# depends on -- everything else is better added per-project or in the
# gitignored *.local.list files.

# Superpowers -- brainstorming, TDD, systematic debugging, plan writing and
# execution, code review, worktrees, subagent dispatch.
obra/superpowers-marketplace

# Compound Engineering -- the ce-* workflow: brainstorm, plan, work, review,
# simplify, commit, handoff.
https://github.com/EveryInc/compound-engineering-plugin.git

# Personal OS -- recall and sync-claude-sessions. Load-bearing, not optional:
# setup_qmd registers a "sessions" collection over $VAULT_DIR/Claude-Sessions,
# and only sync-claude-sessions writes there. Both the UserPromptSubmit and
# Stop hooks in settings.template.json invoke these two skills directly, so
# dropping this marketplace leaves the QMD/vault bootstrap half-wired.
ArtemXTech/personal-os-skills

# Private/work marketplaces belong in claude/marketplaces.local.list
# (gitignored) -- this repo is public.
